        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kelly Preston, Toby Keith, Lindsey Haun, Burt Reynolds, John Travolta, Steven Goldmann\n- Films: Broken Bridges, Mischief, Twins, Jerry Maguire, Battlefield Earth, Trailer Park of Terror\n- Topics: acting, modeling, directing, television programs\n\nFacts:\n- Kelly Preston was born on October 13, 1962.\n- Kelly Preston is an American actress and former model.\n- Kelly Preston has appeared in more than sixty television and film productions, including Mischief, Twins, and Jerry Maguire.\n- Kelly Preston is married to John Travolta, and they collaborated on the fantasy film Battlefield Earth.\n- Broken Bridges is a 2006 film starring Toby Keith, Lindsey Haun, Burt Reynolds, and Kelly Preston.\n- Steven Goldmann directed the films Broken Bridges and Trailer Park of Terror, and he also directed several television programs.",
